This repository contains the preferred source form of the rstudio-zh-cn
localization project, including translation resources, source patch/addition rules,
build and installation scripts, validation, and documentation.

Project source repository:

  https://github.com/SVC1996-code/rstudio-zh-cn

The supported upstream RStudio source is:

  Repository: https://github.com/rstudio/rstudio.git
  Tag:        v2026.08.1+195
  Commit:     8d474bc4cfad0e317095cd171e8ef44db6887068
  Archive:    https://github.com/rstudio/rstudio/archive/refs/tags/v2026.08.1+195.zip
  SHA-256:   25E2AC0EFFCE6D62594B406C3AABFE1E5B2E354339EA8C57EC30147358E8D514

The exact overlay and modifications applied to that source are stored under
translations/2026.08.1+195. The scripts in src/ synchronize, verify, apply,
and build those modifications.

Published RC1 assets (not the current development HEAD):

  Release: https://github.com/SVC1996-code/rstudio-zh-cn/releases/tag/v2026.08.1%2B195-zh-cn-rc1
  Project tag: v2026.08.1+195-zh-cn-rc1
  Project commit: 3227b1d4175ae026fd12de756b297325eeef561f
  Source: https://github.com/SVC1996-code/rstudio-zh-cn/tree/3227b1d4175ae026fd12de756b297325eeef561f

Use that project revision together with the locked RStudio source above to
retrieve the translation overlay, patches, and build/install scripts for RC1.
Later development changes are not included in that published ZIP.

Current Unreleased source additionally includes source-additions.json,
RmdTemplateDisplayNames.java, the R Markdown display contract, and a separately
pinned Panmirror source build. Panmirror source is obtained from:

  Repository: https://github.com/quarto-dev/quarto
  Commit: 63eebf6039c74573f54a87edbc9d29b30d26ceab
  Archive: https://api.github.com/repos/quarto-dev/quarto/zipball/63eebf6039c74573f54a87edbc9d29b30d26ceab
  SHA-256: 1A40F26A6F55E4EE8D9A83EE1653692FAD609A9F9B58D391A76D6B0D6C07D7F8

translations/2026.08.1+195/panmirror-source.json records the source evidence,
lockfile hash and exact source patches. src/Build-PanmirrorZhCn.ps1 and its
tests rebuild and verify it; src/Build-RStudioZhCn.ps1 integrates the outputs.
Build instructions are in docs/build.md. Source matching establishes
compatibility, not proof of bit-identical original bundle provenance.

No new compiled Release is declared by these source changes. A future asset
must identify its actual project commit/tag, both upstream sources, applicable
licenses/notices, build inputs and output checksums, and provide clear,
equivalent access to complete Corresponding Source. Reassess distribution of
the rebuilt Panmirror and its dependencies before publishing; do not substitute
current HEAD for the recorded source of an older asset. See UPSTREAM.md and
docs/release-checklist.md. This repository does not redistribute full RStudio.
